00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:56.890
Blurry phone shots and razor sharp ones, selfies and normal, and you, and you really want to mix in here.

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:01.723
Blurry phone shots and razor sharp ones, selfies and normal pictures.

